Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早在耶稣出生之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long, long before Jesus was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那真的是迷失的世界 就在巴西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is truly the lost world and it's in Brazil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你们妈妈的祖国 也是你们的国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mamma's homeland and your country, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远不要让自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never allow yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱一个人爱得太深 贝茨先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to love someone too deeply Mr. Bates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那会毁了你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底还是来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:53.08,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《雷神桥之谜》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你接了一件案子 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a case Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈 你肯定是传染上了我的观察力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, your faculty of observation is certainly contagious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它使你马上能够洞悉我的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has enabled you at once to probe my secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我接了一个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have a case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一个月的琐事和业务萧条之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after a month of trivialities and stagnation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在车轮终于又动起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wheels move once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以听听吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I share it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎没什么可说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's little to share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你吃了那两个煮老的鸡蛋后 我们再讨论吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will discuss it after you consume those two hard-boiled eggs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们可是我们的临时厨师 优待我们的哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which our temporary cook has favored us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两个鸡蛋的状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their condition may not unconnected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是跟一期有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a copy of the Family Herald{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我昨天看到这本杂志 就在在门厅的桌子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I observed yesterday on the hall table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是煮蛋这样的小事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so trivial a matter as them cooking an egg{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是需要用心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}demands an attention, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这与那本出色的期刊上的爱情传奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is incompatible with a love romance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是相互矛盾的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that excellent periodical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望哈德森太太的假期过得愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope Mrs. Hudson is enjoying her holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该听说过尼尔吉普森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard of Neil Gibson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个金矿之王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gold king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的是那个美国参议员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the America senator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 他是西部某个州的参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well he was senator of some western state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他更为人知的身份是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's better known as{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界上最伟大的金矿巨头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the greatest gold mining magnet in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道这个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在英格兰呆了一段时间了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stayed in England for some time, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约五年前 他在汉普郡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bought a considerable estate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}买了一座相当大的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Hampshire some five years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许听说了他妻子的惨死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have heard of the tragic death of his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 怪不得名字听上去那么熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's why the name is familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚详情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nothing of the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实是 这起案件虽然极其轰动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is that the case, although exceedingly sensational{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后却没有什么难办的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}appears to present no difficulty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被告格丽斯邓巴小姐的个性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The interesting personality of the accused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Grace Dunbar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却也无法掩盖清晰的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not obscure the clearness of the evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们已经被验尸聆讯的陪审团所采信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is if your taken by the coroner's jury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进入警方的法庭诉讼阶段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and also in the police court proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是吃力不讨好的差事 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a thankless business Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能够发现事实 但我改变不了事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can discover facts, but I cannot change them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非出现新的完全出乎意料的事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless some new and entirely unexpected ones come to light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我不知道我的委托人 还有什么好期待的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not see what my client can hope for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的委托人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your client?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我快要染上你那种 对故事进行倒叙的习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm falling into your involved habit of telling a story back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不信这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得先把它读一读{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must read this first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的歇洛克 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Mr. Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能眼睁睁地看着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot see the best woman God ever made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝所创造的最好的女士步向死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to her death without doing all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不尽我所能去拯救她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is possible to save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至连尝试去解释都做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even try to explain them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know beyond all doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐毫无疑问是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Miss. Dunbar is innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您了解事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁又不了解呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这已经成了全国上下 茶余饭后的谈资了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been the gossip of the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却没有一个声音为她说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never a voice raised for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最让我发狂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the damned injustice of it all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这种该死的不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes me crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位女士心地善良{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman has a heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连苍蝇都不忍心打死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wouldn't let her kill a fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我手中握有 连我自己都没有发觉的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I have a clue and don't know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:08:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 只要您能救她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, all I know and all I have and all I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的所知所有连同我这个人 都将听候您的差遣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are for your use if only you can save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没时间细读所有这些剪报的内容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hardly have time to master all these cuttings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以要是你感兴趣的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I must give it to you in a lecture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以把此事的来龙去脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're going to take an intelligent interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.27,0:08:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你详细地说一说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生 据我所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson, as I understand is a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}娶了一位巴西太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who married a Brazilian wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于他的太太我完全不了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for who I know nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了知道她青春已逝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except that she was past her prime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚为不幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was all the more unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她请了一位很有魅力的家庭女教师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a very attractive governess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}负责两个小孩的教育{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who superintended the education of two children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是涉及此事的三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the three people concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}背景就是那所古老的庄园豪宅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scene is the grand old manor house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于这起悲剧嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to the tragedy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就发生在湖上的一座桥上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it takes place across a bridge over the lake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在宅子半英里外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}half mile from the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个猎场看守人夜里在桥上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife was found late at night by a gamekeeper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现了这位太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on that bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她身着晚宴礼服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was clad in her dinner dress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脑袋被一颗左轮手枪子弹打穿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a revolver bullet through her brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体附近没有找到凶器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No weapon was found near her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地找不到任何与谋杀有关的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there was no local clue as to her murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她附近找不到任何凶器的线索 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No weapon near her mark that Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的是不是太简要了？你能不能听得明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this too condensed, or can you follow it clearly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以的 很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's all very clear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为什么要怀疑家庭女教师呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but why suspect the governess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.81,0:09:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃… 首先 有一些非常直接的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in the first place there was some very direct evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死去的女士身上有一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead woman had a note upon her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家庭女教师署名的便条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}making an appointment at the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约死者在桥上见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And signed by the governess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生派他的农庄总管去找警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson sent his farm manager for the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己留守在尸体边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stayed with the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要求不得移动现场的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}insisting that nothing should be removed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到警察在11点过后到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the police arrived just after 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后发现了凶器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there is the evidence of the revolver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一把发射过子弹的左轮手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one discharged chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且手枪的口径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a caliber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与子弹吻合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which corresponded with the bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我在这上面读到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I see it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在她衣柜的抽屉里发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was found in the drawer of her wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她衣柜的抽屉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the drawer of her wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:09:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相当具有毁灭性的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty damning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个陪审团也是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the two juries thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}案件现在提交到了温彻斯特巡回审判庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now referred to the Assizes at Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}动机呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the motive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生是一位很有魅力的男士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson is a very attractive man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他妻子死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If his wife dies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能比那位年轻女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who more likely to succeed her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有可能当她的继任者呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the young lady who had already{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据大家所说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by all accounts received{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的雇主可是对她十分殷勤啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pressing attentions from her employer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱情 财富 权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, fortune, power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都取决于一位中年男士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all depending upon one middle-aged man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用心险恶 华生 十分险恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ugly Watson, very ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且她无法给出不在场的证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor could she prove an alibi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相反的 她不得不承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, she had to admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她当晚九点的确上了桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she was down to the bridge by 9:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个仆人看见她匆匆往那儿赶去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A servant had seen her hurrying there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎结局已经注定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it really does seem final.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而… 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我没搞错的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I'm mistaken that is our client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是我们的委托人提早到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}considerably before his time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有位先生要见您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentleman to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尼尔吉普森先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Neil Gibson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一位叫贝茨的先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Bates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去有些恼怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he looks a bit aggravated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的时间不多 贝茨先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have only a short time, Mr. Bates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道吉普森先生就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Mr. Gibson is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是他庄园的总管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am manager of his estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 他是个恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, he's a villain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个可恨的恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an infernal villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}措辞很强烈啊 贝茨先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong words Mr. Bates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 我不得不加重语气 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have to be emphatic Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间有限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time is so limited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恰好不想让他发现我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not have him find me here for the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你是他的总管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're his manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 我已经告知他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've given him notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再过几周 我就将摆脱他那该死的奴役{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a couple of weeks I shall have shaken off his cursed slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个严苛的人 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hard man Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各方面都很严苛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hard to all about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过他的妻子是他的主要受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his wife was his chief victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对她非常残忍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was brutal to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 是的 先生 十分残忍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, sir, brutal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道她是怎么死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how she come by her death I do not know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过他让她的生活痛苦不堪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let me tell you he made her life a misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是一个来自热带的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a creature of the tropics, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该都知道了 她是个巴西人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Brazilian by birth as you no doubt know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道 请接着说 接着说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I understand. Please continue, continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 具有热带的血统 热带的天性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well tropical by birth, tropical by nature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是太阳的女儿 充满了热情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was a child of the sun and of passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她全身心地爱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved him as only such women can love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都同情她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all felt for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:12:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}憎恶他对待她的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hated him for the way he treated her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过他总是花言巧语又狡诈多端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's plausible and cunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要告诉你的就是这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all I have to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要被他的表象迷惑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take him at face value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他的假面背后还有更多的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is more behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不要挽留我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please don't detain me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就要到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's almost due.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇哇哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生有着很好的忠诚的一家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson has a nice loyal household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「很有价值」才是该用的字眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rewarding is a useful one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生 请直接上楼 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson, straight upstairs, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的朋友和同事 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend and colleague Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这儿明确声明 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me say right here Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这件事上你完全不用担心钱的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}money is nothing to me in this business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能对你发掘真相有所帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can burn it if it's any use{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把钱烧了也没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}enlightening you to the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位女士是无辜的 必须还她清白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman is innocent. This woman has to be cleared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事就靠你来做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说你的数目吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now name your figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的职业收费有着固定的标准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My professional charges are at a fixed rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我通常不做改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not vary them save{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全免费的情况除外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I remit them altogether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 如果金钱对你来说没有什么影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if money makes no difference to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就想想名声吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}think of the reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你能澄清这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you pull this off every newspaper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰和美国的每一份报纸 都会大肆宣传的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in England and America will be booming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个大陆的人们都会谈论你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be the talk of two continents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我不需要什么宣传 吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think I'm in need of booming Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们着眼事实吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let us get down to the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 大多数主要的事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'll find most of the main ones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都能在媒体的报道中看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the press reports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得也没什么好补充的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can add much to them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过如果还有你还有什么 需要进一步弄清的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if there's anything you'd wish more light on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well I'm here to give it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well there is just one point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和邓巴小姐确切的关系是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are your exact relations with Miss. Dunbar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you are within your rights, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问这样的问题 也许是你的权利和职责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe doing your duty in asking such a question Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will agree to suppose so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我可以向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I can assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的关系一直是而且完全是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that our relations were always and entirely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雇主与一位年轻女雇员的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}those of an employer that awards a young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她和小孩相处的时间以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom he never conversed with or even saw{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未跟她说过话甚至是见过她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}save when she was in the company of his children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个大忙人 吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rather a busy man Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于毫无意义的谈话 我既无时间也无兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time or taste for aimless conversations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您早安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这样说到底什么意思 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the devil do you mean by this Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拒绝接受我的案子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you dismiss my case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 吉普森先生 我拒绝接受的是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr. Gibson, I dismiss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是没有这种虚假的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case is quite sufficiently complicated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我增添麻烦 案子本身就已经够复杂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the added difficulty of false information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的意思是我在撒谎喽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning that I lied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽可能表达得委婉一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to express it as delicately as I could, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过如果你坚持这样说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you insist upon the word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不否认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not contradict you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别焦躁 吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be noisy Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现在用完早餐以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find after breakfast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何争吵都是非常令人难受的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any argument most unsettling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想在户外散一下步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest a little stroll in the open air{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再安静地做些思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some quiet thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会对你非常有好处的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be greatly to your advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比你更强的人我都打败过 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've broken stronger men than you Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}惹恼我的人从来不曾有过好下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody crosses me and gets the better of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许多人对我这样说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many have said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我现在还好好地在这儿坐着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so yet here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 他得学的事情还多着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Watson he has a great deal yet to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底是怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How on earth did you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和家庭女教师之间的关系的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about his relationship with the governess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚张声势的 华生 虚张声势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bluff, Watson, bluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.71,0:15:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得 他信里那种热切的非公事话的口吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I considered the passionate and unbusinesslike tone of his letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与他的举止和外表并不相符{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}contrasted with his manner and appearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然他对那名被指控的女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty clear there was some deep emotion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}centered upon the accused woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀有深沉的感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than the victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我于是对他虚张声势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bluffed him by giving the impression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他以为我对此已经完全清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was absolutely certain of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而事实上你只是有所怀疑罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When in reality you were only suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他还会回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he'll come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他肯定会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is sure to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他非回来不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不不不 我亲爱的华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, my dear Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕你在你的记录里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you will not improve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再添上雷神桥之谜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any reputation I have acquired{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对提高我的声名也没有什么帮助的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by adding the Thor Bridge mysteries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担心我做出了严重错误的判断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your annals I fear I made a serious misjudgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 参议员也许是没有回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, the senator may not have returned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他的来信确定无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but surely his letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是代表邓巴小姐聘用了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has engaged you on behalf of Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她才是那个处在危难中的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道我们不去拜访她一下吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might we not pay her a visit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去温彻斯特监狱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cells of Winchester?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那需要得到官方的许可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will require official permits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 我们有办法可以申请到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well we have the means to apply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是很符合职业道德的途径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it may not be quite ethical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却很实用 华生 很实用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But practical Watson, practical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要祝贺你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I congratulate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把我们的难题解决了吗 华生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You solved our problem Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某个多管闲事的小职员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some officious little pip-squeak of a clerk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我们的信和官方许可提出了质疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}queried both the letter and our home office permit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要求吉普森本人 亲自授权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He demanded a personal authorization from Gibson himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过你还是解决了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you sorted it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸好交了好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only by the good fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}碰到了她的律师卡明斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of meeting her lawyer Mr. Cummings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他的担保下 我们可以听她做一次简短的陈述{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He secured a brief audience with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔伊斯·卡明斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Joyce Cummings, a man with a rising reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的声名鹊起当然是得益于她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is certainly in her favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能在这里见到您真是上帝的恩赐 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is providence to see you here Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的案子两天后就要开庭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her trial is in two days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我实在是智穷计尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I really am at my wits ends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找不到任何可以挽救她的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find any evidence to save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是否承认 写过便条并与吉普森太太见过面？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she admit to writing the note and keeping the rendezvous with Mrs. Gibson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她别无选择啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has little choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过除了这点以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But beyond that I have advised her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我还是建议她不要认罪 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to reserve her defense. - Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是歇洛克.福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有他的同事华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his colleague Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.34,0:19:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的雇主吉普森先生聘请我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your employer Mr. Gibson has engaged me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来调查这起令人不快的事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look into this unhappy matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 对吉普森先生我非常感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm very grateful to Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我的指控维持不变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is incredible that the charge against me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been sustained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为在初级法庭上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the whole thing would clear itself up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整件事情就可以得到澄清了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the police court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的小姐 我请你不要存在任何幻想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, dear I beg of you to have no illusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡明斯先生会向你表明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cummings here will assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在所有的证据都是对你不利的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the cards at present are against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生相信你的清白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson is convinced of your innocence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果假装说你的处境不是十分危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it would be a cruel deception to pretend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那将是对你的残忍欺骗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're not in very great danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会实话实说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will conceal nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和吉普森先生的妻子之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were the true relations between you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正的关系如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Mr. Gibson's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许可… 什么许可？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permit… what permit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么敢如此造次 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you take this liberty Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你 卡明斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you Cummings, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我雇佣你不是要你来联合对我耍阴谋的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not engage you sir to conspire against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人说得了我的许可 完全是捏造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men are here under false pretenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并没有授权让他们进行这次探访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not authorize their visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是些骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're deceivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要求他们立即离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I demand their removal at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生 你心智不清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made a disturbance Mr. Gibson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以进疯人院了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}worthy of bedlam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说这话我非让人把你碾碎不可 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have you crushed for this Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嘛 这对你可没什么好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it'll profit you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要走了 警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are leaving superintendent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡明斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cummings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}暂时就到这吧 邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the moment Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须信任歇洛克.福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must put your faith in Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗格森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}街对面的博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an excellent exhibition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正举行非常精彩的展览{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the museum across the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我郑重向你推荐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recommend it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:21:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}博物馆五点钟关门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The museum closes at 5:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1578年做气泡玻璃的工人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The copy of the lease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所签订的契约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the buck-boat glass workers dated 1578.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些法国人 是你的什么亲戚吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Huguenots, are they any relations of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.64,0:21:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波特先生和利夫斯托克城的造纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Potel and this paper making of laver stoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们做钞票的历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've had the manufacture of bank notes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经有一百多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for over 100 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嘛 很高兴得知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's good to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你家某个地方还有些钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's money somewhere in your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:22:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 弗格森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon Mr. Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尼尔吉普森先生想见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Neil Gibson wishes to see you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间是明早11点 在雷神宅邸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Thor Place at 11:00 tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚可能更方便些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This evening will be more convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.58,0:22:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上11点 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The morning, 11:00 Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会不会派汽车来接我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will a motor be sent for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有趟火车 可以直接带你们到雷神村{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a train which will take you to Thor Village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生是个忙碌的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson is a busy man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.41,0:22:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他希望你能准时到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He expects punctuality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道他的态度会有转变？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that he was going to turn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.55,0:22:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赌了一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gambled, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐脸上的表情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's been enough of an impression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以替我们赢得好感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon Ms. Dunbar to turn us back into favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们毕竟是她唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are after all her only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 现在我们得找家舒适的旅馆 来度过这一晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Watson we must find a comfortable inn for the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我们才能在明早9点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can arrive punctually at Thor Place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准时到达雷神宅邸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 9:00 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为他说的是11点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he said 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}9点 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}9:00 Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去见当地警局的考文垂警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meet Sergeant Coventry of the local police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:22:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何情况下 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all events Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更乐意是您而不是苏格兰场来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather have you than Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.07,0:22:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果苏格兰场插手一件案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Yard gets called into a case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}案子破了当地的警方也得不到任何功劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the local loses all credit for success{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是破不了也许就得背黑锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and may be blamed for failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.41,0:23:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说您就不会玩花样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you play it straight so I've heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事我根本不必出面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need not appear in the matter at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您真是太大度了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very handsome of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.07,0:23:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我知道您的朋友华生医生也值得信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your friend Dr. Watson can be trusted I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个问题要问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there is one question I'd like to ask you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.07,0:23:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我只问您一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I breath it to no soul but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您觉不觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think there might be a case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许案子对尼尔吉普森先生本人不利？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}against Mr. Neil Gibson himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就仆人们所说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the servants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他吃完晚餐就进了书房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he retired to his study after dinner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.45,0:23:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在11点来警报之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had no company at all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本就没人陪伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the alarm at 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我考虑过吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes I've been considering Mr. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些美国人比起我们这里的人 更热衷于用手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Americans are readier with their pistols than our folk are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是他的手枪 你知道吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was his pistol, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对中的一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of a pair he had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对中的一把？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of a pair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一把在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.73,0:23:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些先生们总是有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well these gentlemen have all kinds of firearms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样那样的各式各样的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of one sort or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有真正比对过那把特殊的手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never quite matched that particular pistol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盒子是根据一对手枪定造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box was made for two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是尸体所在的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is where the body lay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从报上读到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gathered from the press reports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹是近距离发射的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the shot was fired at close quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}距离非常近 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very close sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在右侧太阳穴附近？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near the right temple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}右侧太阳穴往后一点 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just behind it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体的姿势如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did the body lie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.95,0:24:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仰面躺下 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the back, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.09,0:24:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有搏斗的痕迹 没有脚印 没有凶器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No trace of a struggle, no mark, no weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的左手攥着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The short note from Ms. Dunbar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.72,0:24:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐写的短笺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was clutched in her left hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.97,0:24:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}攥着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clutched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.29,0:24:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们几乎都没法掰开她的手指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could hardly open her fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是最重要的一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is of the greatest importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.21,0:24:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点排除了一种说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It excludes the idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是有人在她死后把便条放到她手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anybody could have placed it there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以制造假证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after death to furnish a false clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.97,0:24:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dear me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得便条写得十分简短{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the note as I remember was quite short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 「9点到雷神桥 G。邓巴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, be at Thor Bridge 9:00 G. Dunbar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.13,0:24:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是那样写的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.99,0:24:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.15,0:24:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便条意思模糊 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point of the note is obscured, is it not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.69,0:24:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 先生 我这样说也许有些鲁莽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, it seemed if I may be bold as to say so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是整个案件中唯一真正清晰的一点啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only real clear point in the whole case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假设便条不是伪造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming the note is genuine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她肯定是之前的某个时间收到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She certainly received it some time before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比方说一两个钟头之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}say an hour or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么她为什么还把它握在左手上呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was she then clasping it in the left hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.91,0:24:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在会面过程中她不必再参考其内容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had no need to refer to it in the interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点看上去不是很值得注意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that not seem remarkable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.52,0:25:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 先生 正如你所说的 也许是值得关注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well sir, as you put it, perhaps it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.56,0:25:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个很古怪啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.57,0:25:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 是的 先生 我们注意到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, sir, we noticed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得是某个过路人干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect it's been done by some passer-by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.75,0:25:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干这个需要下手很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took some violence to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是来自上方的猛烈撞击 而是来自底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a hard knock not from above, but below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.33,0:25:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见栏杆的底端了吗 华生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see some lower end of the parapet Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 和尸体所在位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and in a direct line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚好成一直线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the position of the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许无关紧要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably of no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过没有脚印？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No footprints you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.40,0:25:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 地面如钢铁般坚硬 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ground was iron hard sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没有足迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No marks at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们在这里也没有什么需要知道的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have nothing more to learn here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来早了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are early Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.95,0:26:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准时的情况通常就是如此 弗格森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is often the case with punctuality Mr. Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.52,0:26:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生在开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson is in a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还不能见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not ready to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.45,0:26:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来招待他们 弗格森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of them Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.71,0:26:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你们 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very glad to see you gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然我们来早了一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we are a little early{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们可以看看枪火室？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps we can see the gun room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.44,0:26:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个树敌不少的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who has his enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 是的 要是你们了解他的为人和处事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes if you knew him and his methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他睡觉时还把一把上了膛的左轮手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sleeps with a loaded revolver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:26:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放在他的床头柜里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a drawer by his bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.66,0:27:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一个很暴力的人 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man of violence, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.31,0:27:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有没有见到过他殴打他的妻子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen him strike his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.60,0:27:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 不只一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, more than once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的金矿之王的私生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our gold king does not seem to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.54,0:27:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不像金子那么熠熠生辉啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shine in private life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.63,0:27:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是装凶器的盒子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the box that contained the murder weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.84,0:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对中的一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was one of a pair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.15,0:27:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外一把失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗格森先生肯定知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ferguson is sure to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在陪同我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your consorting with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此你不担忧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}does that hold no alarm for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他伤害不了我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing he can do to hurt me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麻烦你带我们去学习室好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'll be so kind as to show us the schoolroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.29,0:27:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送去美国了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent away on a visit to America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们从母亲那遗传了巴西人的特点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their Brazilian heritage from their mother's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.02,0:27:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐应该是个不错的老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar must seem to be a remarkable teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.01,0:27:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们非常爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children doted on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.41,0:27:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧见了吧 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.75,0:28:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里卡多佛朗哥丘陵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ricardo Franco Hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这些无法攀登的悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the unscaleable cliffs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从未留下过时间和人类的足迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which time and the foot of man have never touched, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开天辟地时留下的怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where monsters from the dawn of history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.53,0:28:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许还在山崖间徘徊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might still roam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.50,0:28:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是马丁斯 一位印第安猎手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Martins, the Indian hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.88,0:28:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的残害对象都是妇女和孩子 令人同情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His victims, women and children, pitiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.41,0:28:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是说玛丽亚·吉普森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that Maria Gibson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.95,0:28:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫉妒邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was jealous of Miss. Dunbar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.81,0:28:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及她对孩子们的影响？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her influence over the children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他们夫妇之间的爱依然存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there was no love lost between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那是因为她看出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was because she could see her husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的丈夫也中了那位女士的魔咒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was under the lady's spell too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.12,0:28:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这滚出去 贝茨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here Bates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝茨先生的看法与此事无关 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bates's views are not relevant Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对我已故妻子的迷恋 导致他歪曲了事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're distorted by his infatuation for my late wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.34,0:28:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道呢 吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows, Mr. Gibson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪些是有关的哪些又是无关的呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is and what is not relevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.34,0:28:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你活像是位外科医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a surgeon who wants every symptom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.91,0:28:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在做出诊断前总要问清每一个症状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he could give a diagnosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为每一个病人都有着自己的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As any a patient has reason in deceiving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:29:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要去欺骗他的医生 隐瞒事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}his surgeon who conceals the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.85,0:29:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和邓巴小姐之间的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the relations between Miss. Dunbar and myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.89,0:29:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此案无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not touch this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.28,0:29:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这个该由我自己来判断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that is for me to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.37,0:29:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大多数男人在他们心灵的某个角落里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most men have a little private reserve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总为自己保留着一块私人的空间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some corner of their souls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.92,0:29:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不希望他人去窥探这个空间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they don't welcome intruders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你突然间侵入了我的这个空间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burst suddenly into mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.77,0:29:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在巴西掘金的时候遇到了我妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met my wife when I was gold hunting in Brazil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是马诺斯一位政府官员的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the daughter of a government official in the Manaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.33,0:29:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是现在用我热情已逝的眼光来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now as I look back with a colder eye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.64,0:29:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还是有着一种热情奔放的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she had a rich passionate nature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.93,0:29:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热带的 情绪不稳定的本性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tropical, ill-balanced, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我所认识的美国女人有着很大的不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}very different from the American women I'd known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.29,0:30:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到激情消逝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only when the romance had passed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才开始意识到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I realized we had nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.43,0:30:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之间毫无共同之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}absolutely nothing in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.37,0:30:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爱渐渐淡去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love faded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.94,0:30:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你知道女人爱的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know the wonderful way of women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.31,0:30:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管我怎么做也不能让她不再爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I might, nothing could turn her from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.19,0:30:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果说我对她苛刻 甚至是残忍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd been harsh to her, even brutal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.60,0:30:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是因为我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was because I knew that if I could kill her love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我能让她不再爱我甚至恨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or turn it to hate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.72,0:30:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那对我们两人来说都会好受些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be easier for us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.92,0:30:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是什么也改变不了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing changed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这些英国的丛林中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still adored me in these English woods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对我的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as she had adored me 20 years before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一如20年前在亚马逊河畔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the banks of the Amazon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.76,0:30:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着邓巴小姐就出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then came Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她同样是位非常美丽的女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is also a very beautiful woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.45,0:30:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll admit to you that I could not live{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生活在同一屋檐下每天接触她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the same roof in daily contact with her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.89,0:30:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不对她产生爱慕是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without feeling a passionate regard for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.94,0:30:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能因此责怪我吗 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blame me Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有这样的情感我不会怪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you for feeling it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.45,0:30:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要怪你向她表达了你的感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should blame you for expressing it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要知道她还是在你的庇护下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she was under your protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well maybe so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会把我的本性说得比实际更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pretending to be any better than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想在我的一生中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess all of my life I've been a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.75,0:30:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要什么东西我都会伸手去争取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's reached out his hand for what he wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这个女人以及她的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never wanted anything more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.95,0:31:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我最想得到的东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the love and possession of that woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.86,0:31:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是这样告诉她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说如果可以的话我会娶她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said if I could I'd marry her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这却不是我力所能及的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was out of my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.81,0:31:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱不是问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money was no object.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.75,0:31:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会尽我所能让她快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do all I could to make her happy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}舒适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.84,0:31:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你非常慷慨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very generous of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.52,0:31:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now see here Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.96,0:31:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来找你是为了证据的问题 而不是道德的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to you on a question of evidence, not morals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.67,0:31:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是要你来批评我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for criticism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.91,0:31:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只不过是看在那位女士的份上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only for the lady's sake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.33,0:31:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才接下这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I take on this case at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她所受到的指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing that she's accused of is worse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不比你所承认的更坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than what you yourself have admitted, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.49,0:31:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你试图去毁掉一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've tried to ruin a defenseless girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.27,0:31:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生活在你屋檐底下却毫无防备能力的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was under your roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.48,0:31:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许有些像你这样的有钱人会反驳我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know some of you rich men must retort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.16,0:31:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过在这个世上并非一切对他人的冒犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all the world cannot be bribed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠金钱的收买就能得到谅解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into condoning your offenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己也是这样想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I feel myself about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我要感谢上帝我的计划没能实现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I thank God my plans did not work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她完全不买我的帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd have none it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她想要马上离开这座房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to leave the house instantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.36,0:31:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她怎么还没走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why did she not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:31:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有别人得依靠她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others were dependent upon her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.86,0:32:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对她来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was no light matter for her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.28,0:32:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们失望可不是件小事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.47,0:32:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向她发誓 再也不会骚扰她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'd sworn that she should never be molested again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.93,0:32:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是她同意留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She consented to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.06,0:32:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过还有另外一个原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was another reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.57,0:32:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她知道她对我的影响力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew the influence that she had over me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比世上任何其它的影响更为强烈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was stronger than any other influence in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她想利用这种影响做些好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to use it for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.65,0:32:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太残忍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cruel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.23,0:32:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毁掉那些无法奋起抵抗你的好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroy good people who can't stand up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非每一个人都有你那样的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone shares your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.77,0:32:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你管它叫公平竞争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call it a fair fight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.88,0:32:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但其实那不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it isn't fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.55,0:32:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的理解很不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw it different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.17,0:32:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她认为一个人过多的财富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She believed that a fortune for one man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.30,0:32:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不应该建立在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was more than he needed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上万个被毁灭的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}should not be built on 10, 000 ruined men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.46,0:32:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无生活来源的人身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who were left without the means of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.39,0:32:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你的孩子你显示出了如此多的柔情与爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your children you show such tenderness and love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.12,0:32:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用同样的方式对待这个世界吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat the world in the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.06,0:32:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她发现我肯听她的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found that I listened to what she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.95,0:33:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是她就留了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she stayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.21,0:33:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着就发生了这件事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then this came along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.89,0:33:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生 你能不能对此说说看法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson, can you throw any light upon it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一种解释 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One explanation, I give it to you Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.69,0:33:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what it's worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.94,0:33:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问我的妻子极端嫉妒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt that my wife was bitterly jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.48,0:33:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也许计划要谋杀邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might have planned to murder Miss. Dunbar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者用枪威胁她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or threaten her with a gun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.06,0:33:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想吓唬她离开我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so frighten her into leaving us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.42,0:33:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许当时有一场混战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there was a scuffle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.93,0:33:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}枪走火了 打中了持枪的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun went off and shot the woman who held it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 是有这样一种可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is a possibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.59,0:33:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是故意谋杀意外的唯一可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only alternative to deliberate murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.98,0:33:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过她完全予以否认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she utterly denies it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.64,0:33:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样的假设怎么能推翻得了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is against such a supposition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.50,0:33:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐本人就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.38,0:33:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一天就要开庭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has just one day left before the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.41,0:33:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须允许我再次去探访她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must grant me permission to visit her once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.50,0:33:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果在你的一生中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If ever in your life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.65,0:33:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你曾经展示过你的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you showed your powers, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.99,0:33:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就把它们用在这个案子中吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put them into this case now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.76,0:33:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我无法向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot promise you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.54,0:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所得出的结论就是你想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my conclusions will be such as you desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.52,0:34:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.41,0:34:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有几个生死攸关的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have several vital questions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.94,0:34:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得去问问这位年轻的女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ask this young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.00,0:34:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I must confess that the case would seem to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.87,0:34:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不是因为一件事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very black one against her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个案子确实会对她十分不利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it were not for one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事情？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.70,0:34:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在她衣柜里发现了手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finding of a pistol in her wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.00,0:34:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那似乎是所有证据中最具毁灭性的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems to be the most damning incident of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.02,0:34:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非如此 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.70,0:34:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我希望的唯一所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my only firm ground for hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.67,0:34:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须寻找事物间的联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must look for consistency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.11,0:34:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在缺少联系的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is a want of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就得怀疑存在着欺骗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must suspect deception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.71,0:34:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.58,0:34:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐还指望我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar is depending on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.15,0:34:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 设想你自己站在邓巴小姐的位置上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson visualize yourself in the character{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.93,0:35:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}预谋用一种冷酷的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Miss. Dunbar with a cold premeditated fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.23,0:35:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除掉她的对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is about to get rid of her rival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.44,0:35:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会怎样行动 会想些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would be your actions and your thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.55,0:35:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 我已经写过便条了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I've written a note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受害人也来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.15,0:35:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从枪火室里拿了手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've taken the weapon from the gunroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.16,0:35:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犯下了罪行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crime is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.66,0:35:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很娴熟 说得很完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Workman like and complete, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.19,0:35:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在是武器了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.02,0:35:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些深渊也许将永远把它隐藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those depths would hide it forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.44,0:35:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好的朋友不会认为你是个善谋的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best friends would hardly call you a schemer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.34,0:35:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而我还是很难想像你把它带回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I cannot picture you carrying it home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.20,0:35:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放进你的衣柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and putting it in your wardrobe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.61,0:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可是第一个会被搜查的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very first place that would be searched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.08,0:35:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说这把手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This revolver for example, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她宣称完全不知道它的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she destains all knowledge of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.14,0:35:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说手枪是被放进她的衣柜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that it was placed in her wardrobe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是谁干的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.58,0:35:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某个想让她获罪的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By someone who wished to incriminate her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.40,0:35:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 卡明斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Cummings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar we have had lengthy conversations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.97,0:35:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们和吉普森先生进行了一次长谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Mr. Gibson and he has informed us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.31,0:35:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把你们的关系以及你的清白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your relations with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.43,0:36:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都告诉了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and of your innocence in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不必再重复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need not pain yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.09,0:36:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}徒增你的烦恼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that part of the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.30,0:36:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我们的确需要了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do need to know something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.26,0:36:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对吉普森太太的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your feelings towards Mrs. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.71,0:36:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想亵渎吉普森太太的在天之灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no wish to wrong Mrs. Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.83,0:36:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过她从肉体的角度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she loved her husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.91,0:36:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狂热地爱着她的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so vividly in a physical sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以至于她无法理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she could hardly understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和他之间那种心灵的乃至精神上的契合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mental even spiritual tie which held him to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.65,0:36:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也无法想像我仅仅是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or imagined that it was only my desire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想影响他去做些好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to influence his power for good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.57,0:36:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才在他家里留了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which kept me under his roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.85,0:36:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在知道了我留下来是个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see now that I was wrong to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.68,0:36:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留在这个是非之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing could have justified me in remaining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.54,0:36:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为一场悲剧的导火线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I was a cause of such unhappiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的委托人也许不想说起它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My client may be loathe to mention it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.10,0:36:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过她曾经说服吉普森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she has managed to persuade Mr. Gibson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.36,0:36:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}资助一项让部族重新定居的慈善计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to finance a mission of mercy to resettle tribes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是波洛洛部族的印第安人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In particular the Bororo Indians{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.67,0:36:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们已经成为了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have fallen victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.01,0:37:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肆无忌惮的金子和橡胶的勘探者的残害对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to unscrupulous gold and rubber prospectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.81,0:37:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种冒险活动现在十分猖獗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The venture is thriving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.14,0:37:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在学校里见到了你的画像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw your pictures in the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.49,0:37:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像那些英勇的印第安人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like so many of those warrior Indians{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.81,0:37:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森先生有时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibson can sometimes give people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.89,0:37:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会给人一种令人误解的印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a misleading impression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.51,0:37:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Miss. Dunbar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能告诉我们那天晚上 到底发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you tell us exactly what happened that evening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天早上我收到了吉普森太太的一张便条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I received a note from Mrs. Gibson in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.25,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恳求我在晚饭后 到桥上去见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It implored me to meet her at the bridge after dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.11,0:37:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那张便条你有没有留着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This note, did you keep it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.51,0:37:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她要求我把便条毁掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked me to destroy it and to hide my answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.86,0:37:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再把我的回复藏在花园的日晷那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the sundial in the garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白为什么要这么偷偷摸摸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw no reason for such secrecy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.69,0:37:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她很怕她的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she was very much afraid of her husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.73,0:37:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他待她十分粗暴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who treated her with a harshness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.89,0:37:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为此我还经常责备他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by which I frequently reproached him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.26,0:37:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能想像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only imagine that she did not wish him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.37,0:37:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不希望他知道我们的会面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know of our interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.13,0:37:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而她非常小心地保存着你的答复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet she kept your reply very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 听到她死时手里还拿着它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was surprised to hear she had it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.51,0:37:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到十分意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in her hand when she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.92,0:38:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来又发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well what happened then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.90,0:38:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她等着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was waiting for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.67,0:38:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底是来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.17,0:38:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到那一刻我才意识到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did I realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.42,0:38:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有多么恨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until that moment how much she hated me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.14,0:38:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.21,0:38:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就像是个疯婆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was like a madwoman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.68,0:38:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想她的确是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she was mad with a deep power of deception{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.90,0:38:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着疯子所有的那种自我欺骗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which insane people may have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.36,0:38:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是残忍 你连心都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cruel, you have no heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.99,0:38:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不知道如何去爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how to love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有激情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她每天见到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else could she have met me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.42,0:38:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又怎能不忧心忡忡呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without concern every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就在桥上站着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was standing there on the bridge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尖叫着诅咒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shrieking her curses at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.50,0:38:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国荡妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.64,0:38:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.36,0:38:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我诅咒终有一天你会被烧死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I curse the day that you were born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假设你离开不久她就被杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet presuming that she met her death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.98,0:38:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你并没有听到枪声？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shortly after you left, you heard no shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.94,0:38:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 我什么也没听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I heard nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.26,0:38:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可怕的发作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so agitated and horrified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:38:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使我又惊又怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by her terrible outbreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.84,0:39:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我冲回房间以寻求安宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I rushed to get back to the peace of my own room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.58,0:39:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全没有注意到所发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was incapable of noticing anything that happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.82,0:39:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早晨之前你离开过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you leave it again before the next morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.02,0:39:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就在他们把那可怜的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, when they brought the poor creature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.57,0:39:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搬回屋的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得吉普森先生是不是看上去十分不安？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Mr. Gibson seem to you much perturbed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.63,0:39:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一个自制力很强的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a very strong self-contained man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.66,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.94,0:39:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从来都不会把情绪写在脸上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would ever show his emotions on the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你是如此了解他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, who knew him so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.35,0:39:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我可以看出他深深的忧虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I could see that he was deeply concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.02,0:39:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们来谈最重要的一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we come to the all-important point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.20,0:39:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那把手枪是在你房间里发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pistol that was found in your room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.34,0:39:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以前从未见过它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd never seen it before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.33,0:39:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never, I swear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么时候发现的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was it found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早上警察搜查的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next morning when the police made their search.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就在你的衣服中吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, among your clothes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 在我衣柜的底部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes at the bottom of my wardrobe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.28,0:40:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个抽屉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in one of the drawers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.70,0:40:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想不出它在那儿有多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you cannot guess how long it had been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.98,0:40:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事发当天早上之前它不可能在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could not have been there the morning before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.35,0:40:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我整理过衣柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I tidied out the wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.11,0:40:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你是说有人进了你的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're suggesting that someone came into your room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.28,0:40:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并把它放在那里想嫁祸给你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and placed it there in order to incriminate you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.16,0:40:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.36,0:40:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.76,0:40:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有可能是吃饭的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it could only have been at mealtime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.31,0:40:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or else during the hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我和孩子们呆在学习室的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I would be in the schoolroom with the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.68,0:40:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是你收到便条的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were when you received the note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.72,0:40:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 从那时开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, from that time onward{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.71,0:40:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个早上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the whole morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.24,0:40:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.99,0:40:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any other point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.23,0:40:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我的调查有帮助呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which could help me in my investigation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.09,0:40:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不起还有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could think of none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我可以跟你私下谈谈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, might I have a word with you in private?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.59,0:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 邓巴小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me Miss. Dunbar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.62,0:41:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我愿意把我的案子给你办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes I'd like to put you my case for believing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.05,0:41:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为我相信吉普森先生才是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Mr. Gibson is the murderer of his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.38,0:41:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他自己也坦言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a man who by his own admission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.01,0:41:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他习惯了毁掉那些挡他道的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is used to breaking people who stand in his path, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.40,0:41:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他的妻子恰好就是挡了他的道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well his wife stood in his path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是邓巴小姐拒绝了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Miss. Dunbar rejected him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.78,0:41:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是还有什么比杀了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what better than to kill the one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.02,0:41:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而嫁祸给另一个更好的法子呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and incriminate the other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.60,0:41:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真可谓是 一石二鸟之计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill the two birds with the one stone so-to-speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.82,0:41:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.36,0:41:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普森的自述是诚恳的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gibson's confession was sincere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.01,0:41:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝茨不是说了嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't it Bates who said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.04,0:41:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个善于花言巧语又诡计多端的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was plausible and cunning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.23,0:41:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的自述也许是一种聪明的伎俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His confession was a clever means{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.24,0:41:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想让我们迷失方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put us off the scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.33,0:41:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样想想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.86,0:41:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不知怎么发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He somehow discovers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.61,0:41:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的妻子安排了一次会面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his wife has arranged a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.10,0:41:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白天的时候他从盒子里拿出了枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the day he takes the two pistols from the box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.36,0:41:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一把打了一发子弹后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One he conceals in the drawer of her wardrobe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.78,0:41:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被藏入了她的衣柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after discharging one barrel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.09,0:42:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以在树林里轻易地开上一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he could easily do in the woods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.94,0:42:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不引起别人的注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without attracting attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.16,0:42:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个晚上他都是一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is alone all that evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.78,0:42:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看见邓巴小姐回来就抓住了机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees Miss. Dunbar return and grasps his opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.29,0:42:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他犯下罪行之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He commits the deed and flings the murder weapon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.57,0:42:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就把武器远远地丢进了湖里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}far into the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.13,0:42:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.83,0:42:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.09,0:42:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我思维迟钝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, I have been sluggish in mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.49,0:42:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缺乏把想象与现实结合的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wanting in that mixture of imagination and reality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.53,0:42:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是我破案的基础啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is the basis of my art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.81,0:42:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你让我非常羞愧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have put me entirely to shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会听到我的消息的 卡明斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be hearing from me Mr. Cummings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.67,0:42:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得到了正义之神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the help of the god of justice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.34,0:42:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我的同事华生医生的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my colleague Dr. Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.45,0:42:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将会给你一个让整个英国轰动的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you a case that will make England ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.21,0:42:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓巴小姐 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Dunbar you have my assurance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.58,0:43:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在真相的曙光的照耀下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the clouds are lifting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.99,0:43:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疑云正在消散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the light of truth is breaking through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.74,0:43:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 华生 来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Watson, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要我们的好朋友考文垂警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need our good friend Sergeant Coventry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个结实的线团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ball of stout twine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一个抓勾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a grappling hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.15,0:43:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓勾？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grappling hook?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.21,0:43:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, I have some recollection that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.75,0:43:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们出来办案的时候你多半带着枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go armed on these little excursions of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.87,0:43:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸好我这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as well for you that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.09,0:43:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的左轮手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than once my revolver has been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.35,0:43:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不只一次成了你的好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a good friend to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.16,0:43:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很少在意自身的安危{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have little care of your own safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.71,0:43:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 在这种事情上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am inclined to be absent minded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.24,0:43:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总是心不在焉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in these matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.49,0:43:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在带了左轮手枪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have your revolver on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.10,0:43:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很重 出奇地重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heavy, remarkably heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.77,0:43:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很结实的玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid bit of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.72,0:43:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I believe this is going to have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.30,0:43:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这把枪和我们正在调查的疑案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very intimate connection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.95,0:43:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着很密切的联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the mystery that we're investigating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不介意把子弹退出来吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind unloading it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天晚上你在家吗 吉普森先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be at home this evening Mr. Gibson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.22,0:44:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有消息要带给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall have some news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.33,0:44:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以有半天时间 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have half a day Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.36,0:44:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前你看见过我出错 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have seen me miss my mark before Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.35,0:44:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对这些事情我有一种本能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an instinct for such things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是这种本能有时也会误导我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it has some times played me false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.06,0:44:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只能试一试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can but try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.36,0:45:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个可否准确地站在尸体所在的地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you both stand exactly where the body lay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.28,0:45:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你关于这位金矿之王的理论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your theory about the gold king, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.13,0:45:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然从心理学的角度讲令人钦佩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}though admirable in its psychology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.11,0:45:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却并不接近事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did not quite adhere to the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.99,0:45:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你自己代入这个女人的角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visualize yourself in the character of a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.67,0:45:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她冷酷地预谋着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who in a cold premeditated fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.31,0:45:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要除去她的对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is about to get rid of her rival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.96,0:45:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我指的当然是玛丽亚 吉普森太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean of course Mrs. Maria Gibson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.58,0:45:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你把吉普森当作罪犯的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all your deductions about Gibson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.67,0:45:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有理论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}being the perpetrator of this crime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.28,0:45:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都可以用他太太来替入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}substitute his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.85,0:45:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想像是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that it was she{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.23,0:45:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从枪火室里拿走了手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took the pistols from the gunroom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.77,0:45:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在树林里开了一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who fired the single shot in the woods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.75,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把枪放在邓巴小姐的衣柜里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who placed the gun in Miss. Dunbar's wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.76,0:45:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷酷 狡猾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold, crafty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.77,0:45:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对每一个细节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}premeditated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都预先做出谋划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}down to the last detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.90,0:46:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是否就是事实？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it ever an exact demonstration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.47,0:46:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的左轮手枪 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My revolver Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.17,0:47:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个充满报复心的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vindictive woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.17,0:47:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个热带来的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a creature of the tropics, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.29,0:47:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满激情 情绪不稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}passionate, ill-balanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.75,0:47:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掩盖了她自己被害的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disguising her own crime and fostering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.83,0:47:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挑起了对无辜受害者的谋杀指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a charge of murder upon an innocent victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你帮助了一个非凡的女人 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have helped a remarkable woman, Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.57,0:48:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一个强悍的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a formidable man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.52,0:48:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it seems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.18,0:48:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非是不可能的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that unlikely they should join forces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.42,0:48:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然我会祝他们一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally I would wish them well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.04,0:48:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是心地高尚 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnanimous of you Watson.{\r}
